{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48209","headline":"嘲许子儒 · 窦昉","name":"嘲许子儒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不能专习礼，虚心强觅阶。\n一年辞爵弁，半岁履麻鞋。\n瓦恶频蒙𢸗，墙虚屡被叉\n映树便侧睡，过匮即放乖。\n岁暮良工毕，言是越朋侪。\n今日纶言降，方知愚计喎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}